1
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her smile, her kindness, her kiss♪</font></font>

2
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her presumptions♪</font></font>

3
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She was in love, she was tired, she walked away♪</font></font>

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Only tears remained♪</font></font>

5
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget♪</font></font>

6
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't let go of her all-or-nothing love♪</font></font>

7
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

8
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪</font></font>

9
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

10
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The light's still on, but you're already far away♪</font></font>

11
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out♪</font></font>

12
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

13
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪My voice echoes, but no one answers♪</font></font>

14
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is this really how it ends for us?♪</font></font>

15
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You don't have to be perfect tobe worthy of Love]</font></font>

16
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Early Spring]</font></font>

17
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adapted from The Early Spring on jjwxc.net, Author: Gu Niang Bie Ku]</font></font>

18
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not bad.</font></font>

19
00:01:40,950 --> 00:01:41,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Show me.</font></font>

20
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:42,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have a look.</font></font>

21
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Let's see.</font></font>

22
00:01:45,510 --> 00:01:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">These photos turned out so well.</font></font>

23
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't you think so?</font></font>

24
00:01:48,490 --> 00:01:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you for being with me these past six years.</font></font>

25
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This one's nice too.</font></font>

26
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All the best.</font></font>

27
00:01:55,430 --> 00:01:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mom,</font></font>

28
00:01:56,510 --> 00:01:58,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is today some special occasion?</font></font>

29
00:01:58,350 --> 00:01:59,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What occasion?</font></font>

30
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the wedding anniversary of me and your dad.</font></font>

31
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

32
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The number you've dialed is not in service.</font></font>

33
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:10,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please check the number and try again.</font></font>

34
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

35
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is anything bothering you?</font></font>

36
00:02:17,830 --> 00:02:18,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing.</font></font>

37
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Say,</font></font>

38
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when are you arranging for us</font></font>

39
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to meet Shang Zhitao?</font></font>

40
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's from Harbin, isn't she?</font></font>

41
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about we fly to Harbin</font></font>

42
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and meet her parents</font></font>

43
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">during the Chinese New Year?</font></font>

44
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once we've met,</font></font>

45
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:38,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we can get the wedding arrangements underway.</font></font>

46
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:40,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've broken up.</font></font>

47
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

48
00:02:42,230 --> 00:02:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told you.</font></font>

49
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all messed up.</font></font>

50
00:02:47,230 --> 00:02:48,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't listen to your dad.</font></font>

51
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nian,</font></font>

52
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is it because you're moving to the US for work,</font></font>

53
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and she isn't happy with that?</font></font>

54
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

55
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry about it.</font></font>

56
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Silly boy,</font></font>

57
00:02:58,950 --> 00:03:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">be nicer to her.</font></font>

58
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be so grouchy.</font></font>

59
00:03:04,390 --> 00:03:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I remember correctly,</font></font>

60
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've been together for years.</font></font>

61
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to cherish her.</font></font>

62
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you understand, Nian?</font></font>

63
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

64
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 22]</font></font>

65
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:25,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Number You Have Dialed Is Not in Service]</font></font>

66
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:46,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

67
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't you leaving for the US?</font></font>

68
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When do you fly?</font></font>

69
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's your mentee?</font></font>

70
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She resigned.</font></font>

71
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Resigned?</font></font>

72
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How does it look?</font></font>

73
00:04:04,390 --> 00:04:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora sold it to me for half price.</font></font>

74
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She was selling all her designer bags</font></font>

75
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at the company's flea market.</font></font>

76
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She never said where she was going.</font></font>

77
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She changed her number.</font></font>

78
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She only said she'd get in touch someday.</font></font>

79
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:30,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to know</font></font>

80
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why no one reported</font></font>

81
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a key employee's resignation to me.</font></font>

82
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're talking about</font></font>

83
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora's resignation.</font></font>

84
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:38,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just want to know</font></font>

85
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why the key employee's resignation</font></font>

86
00:04:39,730 --> 00:04:40,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never came across my desk.</font></font>

87
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:46,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You made the rules.</font></font>

88
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyone below Specialist level only needs approval from the department head.</font></font>

89
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Flora wasn't a Specialist.</font></font>

90
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

91
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're transferring to the US.</font></font>

92
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">HR in China</font></font>

93
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't your responsibility anymore.</font></font>

94
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:04,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You knew about us.</font></font>

95
00:05:05,110 --> 00:05:06,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shouldn't you have told me?</font></font>

96
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I tried to convince her to stay.</font></font>

97
00:05:08,790 --> 00:05:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But she told me</font></font>

98
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there was nothing between you anymore.</font></font>

99
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So tell me,</font></font>

100
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what position was I supposed to take?</font></font>

101
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This suicide video</font></font>

102
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has been making the rounds.</font></font>

103
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They say the man jumped because the pressure became too much.</font></font>

104
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This person</font></font>

105
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">seems to be Flora's friend.</font></font>

106
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sun Yu and I</font></font>

107
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are catching a midnight movie later.</font></font>

108
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:02,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is Sun Yuanzhu not going?</font></font>

109
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lost my best friend.</font></font>

110
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lost the competition I should've won.</font></font>

111
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's the victim's name?</font></font>

112
00:06:19,550 --> 00:06:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Out of respect for the victim's privacy,</font></font>

113
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they didn't release the name.</font></font>

114
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:25,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard</font></font>

115
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:26,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the surname was Sun.</font></font>

116
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's Shang Zhitao?</font></font>

117
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:56,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She left.</font></font>

118
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She left quickly</font></font>

119
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and decisively.</font></font>

120
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She even changed her phone number.</font></font>

121
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But she said</font></font>

122
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she'd get in touch with me later.</font></font>

123
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help me find someone.</font></font>

124
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

125
00:07:21,110 --> 00:07:22,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She quit Lime without a word.</font></font>

126
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Science and philosophy, the steps to solve the puzzles♪</font></font>

127
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Names and places, this entire world too♪</font></font>

128
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let them all slip away, then let time itself fade away♪</font></font>

129
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:45,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Rewrite every rule and old cliché♪</font></font>

130
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let vivid colors run free and tempt the eye♪</font></font>

131
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Build a brand-new Noah's Ark♪</font></font>

132
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Rewrite history, conventions, and moral codes...♪</font></font>

133
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao has probably decided to move back home.</font></font>

134
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:14,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Put rankings and comparisons aside♪</font></font>

135
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The soul's desires are just the tip of the iceberg♪</font></font>

136
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Be proud of yourself, just for being you...♪</font></font>

137
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're an adult.</font></font>

138
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:29,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you say it's over,</font></font>

139
00:08:30,670 --> 00:08:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then don't ever start it again.</font></font>

140
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never will.</font></font>

141
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:39,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The world may change, but your stop hasn't come yet♪</font></font>

142
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Time keeps changing, we are insignificant♪</font></font>

143
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Enjoying this tiny, self-created universe...♪</font></font>

144
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

145
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:54,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Open the world, face the lens of reality♪</font></font>

146
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grateful pup.</font></font>

147
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should go with her.</font></font>

148
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Harbin]</font></font>

149
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Old Couple's Tavern]</font></font>

150
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Slow down.</font></font>

151
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mom said you were hopping around.</font></font>

152
00:10:05,590 --> 00:10:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now look at you.</font></font>

153
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:09,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even young people</font></font>

154
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:10,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">need time to recover from an injury like this.</font></font>

155
00:10:11,830 --> 00:10:13,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A broken bone takes a hundred days.</font></font>

156
00:10:13,830 --> 00:10:15,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm in great shape.</font></font>

157
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Other people need three to five months.</font></font>

158
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be back on my feet in two months.</font></font>

159
00:10:18,470 --> 00:10:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, stop bluffing.</font></font>

160
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's so full of himself,</font></font>

161
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there's no cure for it.</font></font>

162
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just pipe down.</font></font>

163
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:28,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to listen</font></font>

164
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to the doctor's advice.</font></font>

165
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

166
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your mom said you're staying after Chinese New Year</font></font>

167
00:10:40,190 --> 00:10:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and finding a job in Harbin.</font></font>

168
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened in Beijing?</font></font>

169
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't things going so well?</font></font>

170
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

171
00:10:52,190 --> 00:10:54,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can take care of your dad.</font></font>

172
00:10:55,070 --> 00:10:56,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to come home.</font></font>

173
00:10:56,950 --> 00:10:58,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're young.</font></font>

174
00:10:58,590 --> 00:11:00,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is when you should be out chasing your dreams.</font></font>

175
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your dad's always bragging about</font></font>

176
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how amazing</font></font>

177
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his daughter is.</font></font>

178
00:11:06,710 --> 00:11:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That you're doing so well in Beijing.</font></font>

179
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can't</font></font>

180
00:11:10,470 --> 00:11:11,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hold you back.</font></font>

181
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:13,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've talked about it.</font></font>

182
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we can't</font></font>

183
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep the tavern running,</font></font>

184
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:20,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll just move into a retirement home.</font></font>

185
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

186
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you going to a retirement home?</font></font>

187
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

188
00:11:24,430 --> 00:11:25,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Beijing was fine too.</font></font>

189
00:11:26,430 --> 00:11:27,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just that</font></font>

190
00:11:29,190 --> 00:11:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've moved from Harbin to Nanjing,</font></font>

191
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then Nanjing to Beijing.</font></font>

192
00:11:37,190 --> 00:11:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm tired.</font></font>

193
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to come home.</font></font>

194
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to spend time with you two.</font></font>

195
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:43,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you happy I'm back?</font></font>

196
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have my friends here.</font></font>

197
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My classmates are here. You two are here, too.</font></font>

198
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:50,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And my favorite snow.</font></font>

199
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

200
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:54,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as you've thought it through.</font></font>

201
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My sweetheart is free to go wherever she wants</font></font>

202
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and do whatever she wants.</font></font>

203
00:11:59,710 --> 00:12:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're always on my side, Dad.</font></font>

204
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're our only daughter.</font></font>

205
00:12:03,590 --> 00:12:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who else would we love?</font></font>

206
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad, Mom. Don't worry.</font></font>

207
00:12:09,470 --> 00:12:11,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll buy a little place here</font></font>

208
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and start my own business.</font></font>

209
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have faith in me.</font></font>

210
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:16,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No matter where I am,</font></font>

211
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll do just fine.</font></font>

212
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

213
00:12:22,310 --> 00:12:23,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My girl's amazing.</font></font>

214
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at Mom.</font></font>

215
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:27,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at her.</font></font>

216
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Norway]</font></font>

217
00:12:50,590 --> 00:12:51,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's my first time seeing him like this.</font></font>

218
00:12:53,070 --> 00:12:54,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He really fell hard for her.</font></font>

219
00:12:56,310 --> 00:12:57,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I figured that out long ago.</font></font>

220
00:12:58,790 --> 00:13:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you ever seen him</font></font>

221
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">get into a fight over a woman?</font></font>

222
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He even flew back overnight from overseas on New Year's Eve</font></font>

223
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just to see Ms. Shang.</font></font>

224
00:13:21,710 --> 00:13:22,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that the aurora?</font></font>

225
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It is.</font></font>

226
00:13:32,550 --> 00:13:33,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's beautiful.</font></font>

227
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:37,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

228
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shall we go see the aurora next year?</font></font>

229
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

230
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go wherever you go.</font></font>

231
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian,</font></font>

232
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't be sad.</font></font>

233
00:14:06,950 --> 00:14:08,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to praise you.</font></font>

234
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:09,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like you.</font></font>

235
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like every path you've chosen.</font></font>

236
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like going on adventures with you.</font></font>

237
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like all the beautiful places we've seen.</font></font>

238
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I saw them with you.</font></font>

239
00:14:21,020 --> 00:14:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her smile, her kindness...♪</font></font>

240
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

241
00:14:25,470 --> 00:14:27,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The number you've dialed is not in service.</font></font>

242
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:29,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please check the number and try again.</font></font>

243
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:32,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She walked away, only tears remained♪</font></font>

244
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:36,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I can't describe, hear, or find...♪</font></font>

245
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

246
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm watching the aurora.</font></font>

247
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you remember?</font></font>

248
00:14:46,590 --> 00:14:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We said we'd see them together.</font></font>

249
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her fear, her pain...♪</font></font>

250
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you disappeared.</font></font>

251
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I care, I understand...♪</font></font>

252
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

253
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll share them with you.</font></font>

254
00:15:03,830 --> 00:15:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to come see them someday.</font></font>

255
00:15:06,430 --> 00:15:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're really beautiful.</font></font>

256
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:10,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

257
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night...♪</font></font>

258
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry.</font></font>

259
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so sorry.</font></font>

260
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The light's still on, but you're already far away...♪</font></font>

261
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:25,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are so many things I'm sorry for.</font></font>

262
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know I'm a mess.</font></font>

263
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't deserve to be loved.</font></font>

264
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just wanted to tell you,</font></font>

265
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:40,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I miss you.</font></font>

266
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I miss you so much.</font></font>

267
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:49,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I love you.</font></font>

268
00:15:51,070 --> 00:15:52,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I love you.</font></font>

269
00:15:58,070 --> 00:15:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

270
00:15:58,950 --> 00:16:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The number you've dialed is not in service.</font></font>

271
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please check the number and try again.</font></font>

272
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her fear, her pain♪</font></font>

273
00:16:09,420 --> 00:16:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her dreams, the way she pulls away♪</font></font>

274
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I care, I understand♪</font></font>

275
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why are we left in such a mess?♪</font></font>

276
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go...♪</font></font>

277
00:16:23,430 --> 00:16:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke,</font></font>

278
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:25,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what's the point of calling a dead number</font></font>

279
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">over and over?</font></font>

280
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you miss her, care about her,</font></font>

281
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">go find her.</font></font>

282
00:16:33,310 --> 00:16:34,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Book a flight.</font></font>

283
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:36,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She threw away</font></font>

284
00:16:36,950 --> 00:16:38,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything that had to do with me.</font></font>

285
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forget it.</font></font>

286
00:16:43,590 --> 00:16:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go get some sleep.</font></font>

287
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even a sunny day feels mediocre♪</font></font>

288
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

289
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If only one can win in love♪</font></font>

290
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I am willing to lose to you♪</font></font>

291
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe</font></font>

292
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when I broke up with Xin Zhaozhou,</font></font>

293
00:18:48,190 --> 00:18:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was too young.</font></font>

294
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back then,</font></font>

295
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I could let go easily.</font></font>

296
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But this time,</font></font>

297
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I finally understood</font></font>

298
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what it means to be cut by a dull knife.</font></font>

299
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The breakup itself</font></font>

300
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:03,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was quick</font></font>

301
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and clean.</font></font>

302
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But once it sank in,</font></font>

303
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd think of him at most ordinary moments.</font></font>

304
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:15,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That you only see clearly up close♪</font></font>

305
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A non-committal relationship is just a waste♪</font></font>

306
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love is a misunderstanding♪</font></font>

307
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A sudden intimacy♪</font></font>

308
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That bugs you in secret♪</font></font>

309
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more you try to take it back♪</font></font>

310
00:19:30,860 --> 00:19:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more you try to deny it♪</font></font>

311
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The more you are being untruthful to yourself...♪</font></font>

312
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And suddenly,</font></font>

313
00:19:37,430 --> 00:19:38,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my heart</font></font>

314
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would feel empty.</font></font>

315
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I only dare chase an embrace I know I'll miss...♪</font></font>

316
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.</font></font>

317
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Balloons for sale!</font></font>

318
00:19:55,950 --> 00:19:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tough balloons that won't pop easily.</font></font>

319
00:20:02,740 --> 00:20:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A love that barely hurts could never compare♪</font></font>

320
00:20:08,860 --> 00:20:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let it weigh on my mind until the very end♪</font></font>

321
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Like the sudden lurch forward when the brakes are slammed♪</font></font>

322
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And it's already too late for me to turn back♪</font></font>

323
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love is a cliff♪</font></font>

324
00:20:26,460 --> 00:20:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You know it's wrong, yet you don't turn back anyway♪</font></font>

325
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You are sober, but I want to stay under your spell♪</font></font>

326
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪This intense flavor♪</font></font>

327
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love is tears, and the more they overflow, the sadder it becomes♪</font></font>

328
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Once the rainy season passes, I'll decide who to forget♪</font></font>

329
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And no one knows what's true or false♪</font></font>

330
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:15,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello?</font></font>

331
00:21:15,670 --> 00:21:16,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ms. Shang.</font></font>

332
00:21:16,670 --> 00:21:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your company registration has been completed.</font></font>

333
00:21:20,230 --> 00:21:21,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

334
00:21:38,990 --> 00:21:40,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd like to try a hiring experiment.</font></font>

335
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't need you to have a lot of experience.</font></font>

336
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as you're willing to work hard</font></font>

337
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and fight alongside me.</font></font>

338
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll probably be traveling a lot.</font></font>

339
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:48,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It won't be easy.</font></font>

340
00:21:48,030 --> 00:21:49,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How does</font></font>

341
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:50,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">7,000 a month sound?</font></font>

342
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:53,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">7,000? I'd love that.</font></font>

343
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss.</font></font>

344
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're my boss from now on.</font></font>

345
00:21:57,190 --> 00:21:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't I start today?</font></font>

346
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got nothing to do if I go home anyway.</font></font>

347
00:22:01,030 --> 00:22:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Looking forward to it, Fu Dong.</font></font>

348
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:03,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Likewise.</font></font>

349
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright. Got it.</font></font>

350
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss.</font></font>

351
00:22:06,670 --> 00:22:07,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

352
00:22:08,030 --> 00:22:09,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I bought the car.</font></font>

353
00:22:09,230 --> 00:22:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's the key,</font></font>

354
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the transfer papers, and the inspection report.</font></font>

355
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:14,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's second-hand,</font></font>

356
00:22:14,270 --> 00:22:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I think it'll last us</font></font>

357
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:16,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">another three years.</font></font>

358
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By then,</font></font>

359
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:19,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can drive, and I'll ride shotgun.</font></font>

360
00:22:19,430 --> 00:22:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll take on the world together.</font></font>

361
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:22,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why am I the one driving?</font></font>

362
00:22:23,990 --> 00:22:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have a license.</font></font>

363
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll get one soon.</font></font>

364
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Qingtao Creative Event Studio]</font></font>

365
00:22:59,660 --> 00:23:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Founder Shang Zhitao: Six Years at Lime Advertising, Beijing]</font></font>

366
00:23:35,190 --> 00:23:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take care.</font></font>

367
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:37,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take care, Mr. Liu.</font></font>

368
00:23:40,470 --> 00:23:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Another deal done.</font></font>

369
00:23:42,670 --> 00:23:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss, how do you know everything?</font></font>

370
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're so cool.</font></font>

371
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's New Year's Eve.</font></font>

372
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:49,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A few of the new hires and I</font></font>

373
00:23:49,430 --> 00:23:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are getting together tonight.</font></font>

374
00:23:50,120 --> 00:23:52,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want to join us?</font></font>

375
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You guys pick whatever you want to eat.</font></font>

376
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring me the receipt later.</font></font>

377
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the best, Boss!</font></font>

378
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on. Go check it out.</font></font>

379
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:01,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on.</font></font>

380
00:24:01,670 --> 00:24:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pick something good.</font></font>

381
00:24:19,340 --> 00:24:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Recipient: Flora Shang]</font></font>

382
00:24:21,020 --> 00:24:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Happy New Year. Wishing you all the best.]</font></font>

383
00:24:25,020 --> 00:24:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Recipient: Flora Shang]</font></font>

384
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Happy New Year. Wishing you all the best.]</font></font>

385
00:24:28,260 --> 00:24:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪</font></font>

386
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If it never crosses your mind♪</font></font>

387
00:24:39,060 --> 00:24:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The tide as I turn back♪</font></font>

388
00:24:42,740 --> 00:24:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is just formless attraction...♪</font></font>

389
00:24:52,470 --> 00:24:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.</font></font>

390
00:24:58,320 --> 00:25:00,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Balloons for sale!</font></font>

391
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:01,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Balloons!</font></font>

392
00:25:01,270 --> 00:25:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mister, I'd like one balloon.</font></font>

393
00:25:03,430 --> 00:25:04,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here you go.</font></font>

394
00:25:07,340 --> 00:25:11,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I would rather forget myself♪</font></font>

395
00:25:11,740 --> 00:25:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Just this moment♪</font></font>

396
00:25:31,980 --> 00:25:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your aloofness masks your vulnerability♪</font></font>

397
00:25:39,100 --> 00:25:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I hide my nervousness in the corner♪</font></font>

398
00:25:46,140 --> 00:25:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Too many hurdles in this world♪</font></font>

399
00:25:50,260 --> 00:25:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even one moment can keep us warm♪</font></font>

400
00:25:54,860 --> 00:25:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Just this moment♪</font></font>

401
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪All right?♪</font></font>

402
00:26:39,710 --> 00:26:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sun Yu.</font></font>

403
00:26:45,030 --> 00:26:46,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you better now?</font></font>

404
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I am.</font></font>

405
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me give you an update.</font></font>

406
00:26:51,560 --> 00:26:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I bought</font></font>

407
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:53,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a place.</font></font>

408
00:26:53,710 --> 00:26:54,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just finished renovating it.</font></font>

409
00:26:55,430 --> 00:26:57,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had</font></font>

410
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a huge bookshelf</font></font>

411
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:02,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and put all the books Sun Yuanzhu gave me on it.</font></font>

412
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, right.</font></font>

413
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I also started an event planning company.</font></font>

414
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got a few employees.</font></font>

415
00:27:10,030 --> 00:27:11,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An event planning company?</font></font>

416
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:12,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have our marketing manager</font></font>

417
00:27:12,710 --> 00:27:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">contact you.</font></font>

418
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We need new suppliers</font></font>

419
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for some offline events</font></font>

420
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in your province.</font></font>

421
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sounds good.</font></font>

422
00:27:23,230 --> 00:27:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

423
00:27:26,190 --> 00:27:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you want to come visit me in Harbin?</font></font>

424
00:27:29,670 --> 00:27:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

425
00:27:30,600 --> 00:27:31,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Works for me.</font></font>

426
00:27:50,470 --> 00:27:51,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lumi,</font></font>

427
00:27:51,670 --> 00:27:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's me.</font></font>

428
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want to come to Harbin for a few days?</font></font>

429
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:56,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Send me the address.</font></font>

430
00:27:56,670 --> 00:27:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll head over in the next couple of days.</font></font>

431
00:28:17,020 --> 00:28:18,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I'm in high spirits.]</font></font>

432
00:28:18,060 --> 00:28:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I came home wearing a happy smile.]</font></font>

433
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Sun Yuanzhu, reread in 2016]</font></font>

434
00:28:58,140 --> 00:29:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Those Who Left, Those Who Stayed]</font></font>

435
00:29:01,140 --> 00:29:03,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Old Couple's Tavern]</font></font>

436
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:04,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My last boss</font></font>

437
00:29:04,510 --> 00:29:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was always saying,</font></font>

438
00:29:06,320 --> 00:29:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Fudong,</font></font>

439
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:08,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're so sloppy."</font></font>

440
00:29:10,120 --> 00:29:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sloppy?</font></font>

441
00:29:11,330 --> 00:29:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His business</font></font>

442
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wasn't worthy of my talents.</font></font>

443
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:16,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was all office politics.</font></font>

444
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But after joining Boss Tao,</font></font>

445
00:29:20,360 --> 00:29:21,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I finally understood</font></font>

446
00:29:21,990 --> 00:29:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what</font></font>

447
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">world-class ad planning looks like.</font></font>

448
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of our clients</font></font>

449
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:28,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has been dissatisfied with</font></font>

450
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">any of my boss's proposals.</font></font>

451
00:29:32,230 --> 00:29:32,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course,</font></font>

452
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know</font></font>

453
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:37,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm still lacking.</font></font>

454
00:29:37,750 --> 00:29:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After all, I don't have much experience.</font></font>

455
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you know what my boss always says?</font></font>

456
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:43,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"I'm not afraid you don't know.</font></font>

457
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:46,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm only afraid you won't learn."</font></font>

458
00:29:47,030 --> 00:29:48,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on. Here's to my boss.</font></font>

459
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keep it up, young man.</font></font>

460
00:29:53,430 --> 00:29:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now that's the right attitude.</font></font>

461
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao has really grown.</font></font>

462
00:29:56,990 --> 00:29:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brother-in-law!</font></font>

463
00:29:58,320 --> 00:29:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing here?</font></font>

464
00:29:59,160 --> 00:29:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're here too?</font></font>

465
00:30:00,270 --> 00:30:01,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I brought some colleagues for lunch.</font></font>

466
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll head over first.</font></font>

467
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What brings you here?</font></font>

468
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:05,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not busy today?</font></font>

469
00:30:06,750 --> 00:30:07,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're here too.</font></font>

470
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:09,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me introduce you.</font></font>

471
00:30:09,950 --> 00:30:11,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is my best friend from Beijing.</font></font>

472
00:30:11,990 --> 00:30:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xing Yi.</font></font>

473
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is Lumi.</font></font>

474
00:30:13,560 --> 00:30:13,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nice to meet you.</font></font>

475
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nice to meet you too.</font></font>

476
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:15,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm Xing Yi.</font></font>

477
00:30:15,230 --> 00:30:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I looked after her when she was in Beijing.</font></font>

478
00:30:18,400 --> 00:30:19,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead and eat.</font></font>

479
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll check on my colleagues.</font></font>

480
00:30:20,670 --> 00:30:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. Go ahead.</font></font>

481
00:30:21,470 --> 00:30:21,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

482
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:27,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brother-in-law?</font></font>

483
00:30:27,470 --> 00:30:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What does that mean?</font></font>

484
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My middle school classmate.</font></font>

485
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fu Dong just calls him that</font></font>

486
00:30:32,660 --> 00:30:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to act like they're close.</font></font>

487
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:36,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xing Yi.</font></font>

488
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Xing.</font></font>

489
00:30:38,470 --> 00:30:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's a big shot around here.</font></font>

490
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Long story short,</font></font>

491
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he has introduced us</font></font>

492
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to a lot of great suppliers.</font></font>

493
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's taken really good care of my boss...</font></font>

494
00:30:49,660 --> 00:30:50,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean, my boss's tavern.</font></font>

495
00:30:52,030 --> 00:30:53,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's just teasing.</font></font>

496
00:30:53,990 --> 00:30:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to head back to Beijing later.</font></font>

497
00:30:56,750 --> 00:30:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't miss me too much.</font></font>

498
00:30:57,950 --> 00:30:58,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

499
00:30:58,360 --> 00:30:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fill my glass.</font></font>

500
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:00,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since I'm here</font></font>

501
00:31:00,670 --> 00:31:02,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the great Northeast,</font></font>

502
00:31:02,710 --> 00:31:04,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">let's raise a toast to Boss Shang.</font></font>

503
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:05,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And to</font></font>

504
00:31:06,510 --> 00:31:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xing...</font></font>

505
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Xing.</font></font>

506
00:31:08,190 --> 00:31:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A toast to Mr. Xing.</font></font>

507
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:10,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheers.</font></font>

508
00:31:10,190 --> 00:31:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- To Mr. Xing. - Cheers.</font></font>

509
00:31:11,670 --> 00:31:12,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

510
00:31:12,430 --> 00:31:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you drinking tea?</font></font>

511
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm driving later. Can't drink.</font></font>

512
00:31:15,190 --> 00:31:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll drink tea instead.</font></font>

513
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:16,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

514
00:31:16,430 --> 00:31:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's drink till we drop.</font></font>

515
00:31:18,170 --> 00:31:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No problem.</font></font>

516
00:31:27,950 --> 00:31:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

517
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd better get going.</font></font>

518
00:31:29,670 --> 00:31:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Text me next time.</font></font>

519
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take you out for dinner sometime.</font></font>

520
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:34,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just the two of us.</font></font>

521
00:31:34,230 --> 00:31:34,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

522
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't come out. It's chilly.</font></font>

523
00:31:36,470 --> 00:31:37,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

524
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you come down, Mom?</font></font>

525
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can clean everything myself.</font></font>

526
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on</font></font>

527
00:31:52,400 --> 00:31:53,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">between you and Xing Yi?</font></font>

528
00:31:53,710 --> 00:31:54,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold your horses.</font></font>

529
00:31:54,670 --> 00:31:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't start imagining things.</font></font>

530
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've known each other for too long.</font></font>

531
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at you.</font></font>

532
00:32:00,080 --> 00:32:00,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well,</font></font>

533
00:32:01,080 --> 00:32:02,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're not</font></font>

534
00:32:02,270 --> 00:32:03,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">getting any younger.</font></font>

535
00:32:04,190 --> 00:32:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If things aren't happening with Xing Yi,</font></font>

536
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're going on blind dates</font></font>

537
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">starting tomorrow.</font></font>

538
00:32:10,230 --> 00:32:10,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mom.</font></font>

539
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you only think I'm doing well</font></font>

540
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:15,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I get married?</font></font>

541
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not what I mean.</font></font>

542
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just mean</font></font>

543
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:23,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you haven't gotten over</font></font>

544
00:32:23,430 --> 00:32:24,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your last relationship.</font></font>

545
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:27,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I read online</font></font>

546
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that the best way to get over an old relationship</font></font>

547
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is to start a new one.</font></font>

548
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right?</font></font>

549
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No matter what,</font></font>

550
00:32:34,710 --> 00:32:36,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether it was good or bad, you've broken up.</font></font>

551
00:32:36,950 --> 00:32:38,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now you have to</font></font>

552
00:32:38,750 --> 00:32:40,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep loving life</font></font>

553
00:32:40,270 --> 00:32:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and love the person who deserves your love.</font></font>

554
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:43,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't you think?</font></font>

555
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just don't like blind dates.</font></font>

556
00:32:47,080 --> 00:32:48,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It has nothing to do with him.</font></font>

557
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Love is all about fate.</font></font>

558
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I'll get married.</font></font>

559
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:54,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I won't.</font></font>

560
00:32:54,670 --> 00:32:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For now,</font></font>

561
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just want to get to know someone slowly</font></font>

562
00:32:57,210 --> 00:32:58,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and let things happen naturally.</font></font>

563
00:32:58,920 --> 00:32:59,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does that sound okay?</font></font>

564
00:33:03,360 --> 00:33:03,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

565
00:33:04,710 --> 00:33:06,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then your dad and I will save up a little more for you.</font></font>

566
00:33:06,710 --> 00:33:07,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright?</font></font>

567
00:33:07,190 --> 00:33:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

568
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll save together.</font></font>

569
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave them. I'll carry them.</font></font>

570
00:33:27,190 --> 00:33:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come in.</font></font>

571
00:33:30,030 --> 00:33:30,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss,</font></font>

572
00:33:31,190 --> 00:33:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard you're back.</font></font>

573
00:33:33,470 --> 00:33:34,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something to tell you.</font></font>

574
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:36,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on.</font></font>

575
00:33:40,230 --> 00:33:41,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got a project.</font></font>

576
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You might want to take a look.</font></font>

577
00:33:43,950 --> 00:33:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What kind of project</font></font>

578
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:45,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">needs my attention?</font></font>

579
00:33:47,950 --> 00:33:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring it to your boss, Will.</font></font>

580
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's the thing.</font></font>

581
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got</font></font>

582
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:53,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">an international summit</font></font>

583
00:33:53,950 --> 00:33:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for a beer brand.</font></font>

584
00:33:54,990 --> 00:33:56,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They want an offline event.</font></font>

585
00:33:56,750 --> 00:33:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I picked Harbin,</font></font>

586
00:33:59,950 --> 00:34:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but Will is against it.</font></font>

587
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think</font></font>

588
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:04,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Harbin has huge potential.</font></font>

589
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:05,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's worth investing in.</font></font>

590
00:34:08,430 --> 00:34:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I printed out</font></font>

591
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the supplier rankings.</font></font>

592
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think the top one</font></font>

593
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">deserves a closer look.</font></font>

594
00:34:19,980 --> 00:34:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Shang Zhitao]</font></font>

595
00:34:33,200 --> 00:34:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave the list here.</font></font>

596
00:34:34,630 --> 00:34:35,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll look at it myself.</font></font>

597
00:34:36,470 --> 00:34:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You got it.</font></font>

598
00:34:38,030 --> 00:34:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lumi.</font></font>

599
00:34:40,240 --> 00:34:41,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm in on this project</font></font>

600
00:34:41,680 --> 00:34:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from start to finish.</font></font>

601
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You bet.</font></font>

602
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:04,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lumi, long time no see.</font></font>

603
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:05,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Fu Dong. - You've lost weight.</font></font>

604
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is our boss,</font></font>

605
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

606
00:35:13,470 --> 00:35:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello, Mr. Luan.</font></font>

607
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm Ms. Shang's assistant.</font></font>

608
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My name is Fu Dong.</font></font>

609
00:35:21,430 --> 00:35:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's Ms. Shang?</font></font>

610
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The summit is around the corner.</font></font>

611
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:25,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's been working around the clock these past few days.</font></font>

612
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She insists on handling a lot of things herself.</font></font>

613
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:30,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's probably at the venue now.</font></font>

614
00:35:30,590 --> 00:35:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When can we see her?</font></font>

615
00:35:33,590 --> 00:35:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll give her a call and see.</font></font>

616
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me a minute.</font></font>

617
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:37,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't we check into the hotel</font></font>

618
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:38,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get some rest in the meantime?</font></font>

619
00:35:38,430 --> 00:35:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you need anything during your stay,</font></font>

620
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just let me know.</font></font>

621
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

622
00:35:50,630 --> 00:35:51,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lumi.</font></font>

623
00:35:51,950 --> 00:35:53,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's the plan for tomorrow?</font></font>

624
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everything is set.</font></font>

625
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I also arranged a few local media outlets.</font></font>

626
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Think of it as my gift to you.</font></font>

627
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By the way,</font></font>

628
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:02,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the day after is all arranged too.</font></font>

629
00:36:02,990 --> 00:36:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go over everything again tomorrow night.</font></font>

630
00:36:05,150 --> 00:36:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come see me when you're done.</font></font>

631
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't meet with you today.</font></font>

632
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:09,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go enjoy yourself.</font></font>

633
00:36:10,430 --> 00:36:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tomorrow,</font></font>

634
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll give Lime</font></font>

635
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:15,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the most elegant and luxurious summit.</font></font>

636
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I believe you.</font></font>

637
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's not coming.</font></font>

638
00:37:18,900 --> 00:37:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her fear, her pain♪</font></font>

639
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her dreams, the way she pulls away♪</font></font>

640
00:37:25,380 --> 00:37:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I care, I understand♪</font></font>

641
00:37:27,220 --> 00:37:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why are we left in such a mess?♪</font></font>

642
00:37:32,060 --> 00:37:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go♪</font></font>

643
00:37:34,940 --> 00:37:36,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Of her all-or-nothing love♪</font></font>

644
00:37:38,780 --> 00:37:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

645
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪</font></font>

646
00:37:45,540 --> 00:37:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

647
00:37:52,060 --> 00:37:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If my future doesn't lead me to you...♪</font></font>

648
00:37:56,950 --> 00:37:57,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

649
00:37:58,680 --> 00:37:59,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lumi.</font></font>

650
00:37:59,720 --> 00:38:00,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great work.</font></font>

651
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:04,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was watching the rehearsal for quite a while just now.</font></font>

652
00:38:04,510 --> 00:38:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's the host?</font></font>

653
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the host.</font></font>

654
00:38:08,680 --> 00:38:09,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop kidding.</font></font>

655
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not kidding. I'm the host.</font></font>

656
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's an international summit,</font></font>

657
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">broadcast live across five countries</font></font>

658
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in three languages.</font></font>

659
00:38:17,200 --> 00:38:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you handle that?</font></font>

660
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's exactly why.</font></font>

661
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:22,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hiring someone from Beijing would've cost me twenty thousand.</font></font>

662
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:24,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I figured I might as well do it myself.</font></font>

663
00:38:24,070 --> 00:38:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can save the money.</font></font>

664
00:38:25,070 --> 00:38:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm telling you,</font></font>

665
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:27,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted this summit to be held in Harbin.</font></font>

666
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those are all my biggest clients.</font></font>

667
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,950
